{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06968","headline":"读前汉外戚传 · 李嶷","name":"读前汉外戚传","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人录尚书事，家临御路傍。\n凿池通渭水，避暑借明光。\n印绶妻封邑，轩车子拜郎。\n宠因宫掖里，势极必先亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嶷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}